ait, sans bruit, sans devise","t":69.08,"e":71.48,"w":[["Pendant",69.08,69.28],["c'temps",69.36,69.42],["l'gaou",69.54,69.74],["qu'on",69.66,69.76],["moquait",69.82,70.04],["plantait",70.1,70.34],["bâtissait",70.42,70.8],["sans",70.86,70.96],["bruit",71,71.1],["sans",71.21,71.41],["devise",71.32,71.48]],"ok":0.82},{"text":"Il parlait pas, il bossait, il visait, il misait tout sur l'effort","t":71.5,"e":74.16,"w":[["Il",71.5,71.56],["parlait",71.62,71.88],["pas",71.92,72.04],["il",72.44,72.48],["bossait",72.52,72.76],["il",72.84,72.92],["visait",72.96,73.16],["il",73.18,73.24],["misait",73.28,73.52],["tout",73.56,73.66],["sur",73.7,73.82],["l'effort",73.86,74.16]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Aujourd'hui il a deux taxis — nous des « si », des « j'aurais dû », des remords","t":74.2,"e":76.62,"w":[["Aujourd'hui",74.2,74.56],["il",74.59,74.79],["a",74.62,74.7],["deux",74.76,74.86],["taxis",74.9,75.16],["nous",75.24,75.32],["des",75.34,75.54],["si",75.36,75.56],["des",75.38,75.76],["j'aurais",75.8,76.06],["dû",76.12,76.22],["des",76.24,76.3],["remords",76.34,76.62]],"ok":0.77},{"text":"L'escargot qui avance bat le lion qui ronfle au soleil","t":76.68,"e":79.24,"w":[["L'escargot",76.68,77.28],["qui",77.34,77.44],["avance",77.54,77.88],["bat",77.92,78.02],["le",78.08,78.16],["lion",78.2,78.34],["qui",78.38,78.46],["ronfle",78.52,78.7],["au",78.72,78.76],["soleil",78.84,79.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le malin qui fait rien, c'est l'gaou d'demain — c'est pareil","t":79.3,"e":81.54,"w":[["Le",79.3,79.36],["malin",79.42,79.68],["qui",79.7,79.82],["fait",79.86,79.94],["rien",79.98,80.12],["c'est",80.16,80.24],["l'gaou",80.44,80.64],["d'demain",80.64,80.88],["c'est",80.92,81.02],["pareil",81.1,81.54]],"ok":0.9},{"text":"On tombe, on se relève, eh-eh","t":82.18,"e":84.42,"w":[["On",82.18,82.36],["tombe",82.42,82.6],["on",82.62,82.7],["se",82.76,82.82],["relève",82.88,83.88],["eh-eh",84.22,84.42]],"ok":0.83},{"text":"On bara, on rêve, oh-oh","t":84.56,"e":86.63,"w":[["On",84.56,84.74],["bara",8